9.64,0:01:31.01,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:01:29.66,0:01:31.01,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.69,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:01:29.71,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:01:29.74,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:01:29.76,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,cDialogue: 1,0:01:29.79,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:01:29.81,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.84,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:01:29.86,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:29.89,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,yDialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:34.91,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,and keep on going through the hard knock days.Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.91,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:01:29.99,0:01:30.43,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.13,0:01:30.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.37,0:01:30.84,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,muDialogue: 2,0:01:30.54,0:01:31.06,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,beDialogue: 2,0:01:30.76,0:01:31.31,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kiDialogue: 2,0:01:31.01,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,hardDialogue: 2,0:01:31.37,0:01:32.07,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,knockDialogue: 2,0:01:31.67,0:01:34.83,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,daysDialogue: 0,0:01:42.61,0:01:45.53,Title,,0,0,240,,Zoro vs. PicaDialogue: 0,0:01:51.32,0:01:55.34,Captions,,970,0,290,,Dressrosa                SMILE FactoryDialogue: 0,0:02:01.40,0:02:04.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:07.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.22,0:02:09.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:16.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Take this despicable factory that caused you Tontattans so much pain...Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.66,0:02:19.46,Main,,0,0,0,,and tear it down!Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.56,0:02:24.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.20,0:02:27.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Fraland!Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.94,0:02:31.74,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Tontattans, good luck...Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.12,0:02:40.14,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,You handle the mess up there...Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.90,0:02:41.88,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.00,0:03:00.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Help the injured first! Call the rescue team!Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.66,0:03:01.16,Main,,0,0,5,,Aye!Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.05,0:03:04.01,Captions,,0,0,175,,Royal Palace GroundsDialogue: 0,0:03:07.85,0:03:10.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Showtime!Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.07,0:03:18.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Half Moon...Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.45,0:03:19.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Glaive!Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.95,0:03:24.00,Captions,,0,830,255,,Fourth Step                Sunflower FieldDialogue: 0,0:03:24.45,0:03:25.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Kyros!Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.00,0:03:26.17,Captions,,0,830,170,,Kyros  vs. DiamanteDialogue: 0,0:03:26.83,0:03:29.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Just now, you were lashing out at me in rage.Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.05,0:03:32.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten your place?Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.11,0:03:40.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you think that I'm merely a talented matador who can make things ripple?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.35,0:03:46.59,Main,,0,0,0,,You couldn't remain the Colosseum's strongest warrior forever, you know!Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.01,0:03:49.93,Main,,0,0,0,,My skill is indisputable.Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.93,0:03:56.97,Main,,0,0,0,,The current hero of the Colosseum is me, Diamante-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.11,0:04:01.05,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care about that title!Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.65,0:04:04.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, the rippling does help.Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.79,0:04:15.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Father!Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.05,0:04:20.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Nice try! You almost had me!Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.13,0:04:26.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, of course it would come to this.Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.15,0:04:30.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You've been running around the country all day,Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:35.23,Main,,0,0,0,,and fighting me on this rippling arena while trying to keep your daughter safe!Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.61,0:04:37.84,Main,,0,0,0,,And on just one leg, at that!Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.95,0:04:41.07,Main,,0,0,0,,An ordinary person would have long since stopped moving.Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.59,0:04:45.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about my leg.Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.75,0:04:51.73,Main,,0,0,0,,If I wanted to use it as an excuse, I wouldn't have come to this battlefield!Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.29,0:04:57.35,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of my missing leg! I gave it up for the man who saved my life!Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.63,0:05:01.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. Then, I'll gladly aim for your weak spot.Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.07,0:05:08.73,Main,,0,0,0,,It'd be no fun to kill you the old-fashioned way, now that you're so worn out.Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.87,0:05:12.33,Main,,0,0,0,,How about a game?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.16,0:05:20.37,Main,,0,0,0,,The last showtime!Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.21,0:05:27.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that...Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.61,0:05:28.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Confetti?Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.97,0:05:30.07,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.19,0:05:35.09,Main,,0,0,0,,It's something that looks like paper, thanks to my ripple power.Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.97,0:05:39.01,Main,,0,0,0,,And now, I'll undo my power.Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.03,0:05:41.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Ripple Release!Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.27,0:05:45.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Spiked iron balls!Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.21,0:05:51.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Gaze upon their beauty! They're like stardust!Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.01,0:05:52.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin-san!Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.09,0:05:54.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like we can avoid it.Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.89,0:05:57.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Robiland, please protect Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.69,0:05:59.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Commander-san, you're in danger too!Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.11,0:06:02.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine!Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.91,0:06:06.39,Main,,0,0,0,,You're panicking, I see. Very perceptive of you.Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.95,0:06:12.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, this stardust can slaughter entire armies!Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.15,0:06:15.33,Main,,0,0,0,,It'd take a miracle for you to survive.Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.51,0:06:17.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness we're at the Sunflower Field.Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.03,0:06:19.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Mil Fleur!Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.03,0:06:19.24,Note,,0,0,0,,Thousand FlowerDialogue: 0,0:06:23.19,0:06:25.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I have to pluck such magnificent flowers.Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.99,0:06:31.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Struggle all you want!Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:34.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Adios!Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.81,0:06:37.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Death Enjambre!Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.83,0:06:37.27,Note,,0,0,0,,Death SwarmDialogue: 0,0:06:44.63,0:06:45.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Flower Umbrella!Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.13,0:06:49.22,Main,,0,0,0,,That was close!Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.67,0:06:52.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? Quite impressive.Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.21,0:06:53.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Pay attention!Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.59,0:06:58.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Kyros!Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.05,0:07:03.77,Main,,0,0,0,,If an army were to fall to this kind of attack, they'd be truly pathetic!Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.95,0:07:05.99,Main,,0,0,0,,That's so crazy!Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.19,0:07:09.33,Main,,0,0,0,,He's swatting away every single spiked iron ball!Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.87,0:07:14.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Can he make it through a rain shower without even getting wet?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.53,0:07:15.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.89,0:07:29.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Father!Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.35,0:07:33.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Look out above, Kyros!Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.19,0:07:38.65,Main,,0,0,0,,You klutz! How could you trip now?Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.79,0:07:41.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Diamante! I'll get you!Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.85,0:07:43.84,Main,,0,0,0,,No, Rebecca! They're still falling!Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.75,0:07:47.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Father!Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.67,0:07:48.67,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.27,0:07:52.01,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for everything, Diamante!Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.59,0:07:57.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Well said, Rebecca! Go ahead, make me pay!Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.49,0:08:00.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Fight me! I'll kill you with my own two hands!Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.89,0:08:02.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Just like I did your mother!Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.97,0:08:06.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Let go of me, Robin-san! I'll kill him!Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.63,0:08:16.15,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,How long will this last?! The Flower Umbrella can't take any more!Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.67,0:08:22.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Diamante!Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.27,0:08:39.43,Main,,0,0,0,,This is my fight, Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.63,0:08:40.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Drop...Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.81,0:08:43.29,Main,,0,0,0,,your sword!Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.77,0:08:49.85,Main,,0,0,0,,For an entire decade...Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.95,0:08:53.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Father! Get under the umbrella! You'll die!Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.53,0:08:57.49,Main,,0,0,0,,...you have followed your mother's wish!Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.31,0:09:02.13,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Mother said that it's bad to hurt people.Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.29,0:09:04.95,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm teaching you this so that you don't get hurt.Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.50,0:09:08.95,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,She's never hurt anyone,Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.07,0:09:11.79,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,and she's won all her battles by ring out!Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.91,0:09:13.71,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,She's the undefeated woman!Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.35,0:09:18.41,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You can't even cut your enemy and you call yourself a winner?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.47,0:09:20.01,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Shed some blood, Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.15,0:09:22.13,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You coward!Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:25.03,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,That match was a complete disgrace!Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.51,0:09:27.90,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're the shame of all gladiators!Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.16,0:09:30.98,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Drop dead, Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.09,0:09:33.03,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Your family's a bunch of monsters!Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.19,0:09:35.29,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You foul-blooded wench!Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.33,0:09:43.82,Main,,0,0,0,,You've been fighting in the Colosseum, but you still haven't hurt anybody!Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.17,0:09:49.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Your hands are still beautiful!Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.97,0:09:51.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Those are the hands...Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.85,0:09:56.63,Main,,0,0,0,,in which your mother Scarlett's spirit lives!Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.67,0:10:03.99,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Mother...Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.75,0:10:11.39,Main,,0,0,0,,After all your efforts, there's no need to bathe them in the blood of a devil like him.Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:19.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.49,0:10:23.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you never have to swing your sword again!Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.23,0:10:42.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Kyros!Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.43,0:10:47.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you made of iron?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.50,0:10:56.54,Main,,0,0,0,,No, this guy is beyond insane...Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.65,0:11:04.79,Main,,0,0,0,,The pain...Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.50,0:11:09.48,Main,,0,0,0,,The pain is proof that I am human!Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.90,0:11:12.70,Main,,0,0,0,,You people would never understand...Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.56,0:11:20.00,Main,,0,0,0,,The despair of being forgotten by the ones you love!Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.80,0:11:23.00,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Scarlett!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.00,0:11:28.90,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Why? Why didn't you wait for me?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.80,0:11:33.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Of course.Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.82,0:11:36.40,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I must have disappeared from your mind, too.Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.34,0:11:40.94,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Both our promise... and our time together...Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.34,0:11:46.70,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are...Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:49.00,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,It's me! It's Kyros!Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.48,0:11:51.17,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Please...Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.60,0:12:01.72,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,With these tin arms, I can't even feel your fading warmth!Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.58,0:12:15.60,Main,,0,0,0,,You people don't understand...Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.03,0:12:20.26,Main,,0,0,0,,The agony of being unable to feel anything you touch!Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.38,0:12:25.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Or the tragedies that have befallen Dressrosa... Compared to them,Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.02,0:12:28.84,Main,,0,0,0,,this is not even pain!Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.70,0:12:34.54,Main,,0,0,0,,If you want to say I'm made of something,Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.98,0:12:41.12,Main,,0,0,0,,then I'll become this country's fury incarnate...Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.97,0:12:45.70,Main,,0,0,0,,and bring you down!Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.76,0:12:52.42,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,How is he this strong?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:59.36,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Your glory days were twenty years ago!Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.12,0:13:06.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate my true skill with the sword!Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.78,0:13:13.40,Main,,0,0,0,,You're still not dead?! You damn monster!Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.76,0:13:27.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Just as the iron rain lifted, too.Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.82,0:13:34.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll end this by killing you myself.Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.68,0:13:39.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Just like Scarlett, who you two loved so much!Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.70,0:13:53.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Diamante, you fiend!Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.74,0:13:55.60,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you bring up my sister again!Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.06,0:13:59.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Diamante!Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.54,0:14:04.08,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, King Riku!Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.62,0:14:09.56,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We searched as hard as we could, but all for naught! A man named Diamante got there before us,Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.01,0:14:13.40,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,and we found Scarlett-sama lying in the streets,Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:15.26,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,shot to death!Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.52,0:14:20.90,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You killed my sister?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.12,0:14:24.36,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, she was your older sister!Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.76,0:14:28.30,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,She was buying food at a market in the town.Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.54,0:14:33.83,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If the fool could've controlled her hunger, she wouldn't have had to die!Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.18,0:14:37.02,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Let go of me, Tank!Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.26,0:14:40.59,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Please stop!  Don't do anything rash!Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.68,0:14:42.72,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.86,0:14:45.56,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We'll stay in the palace, too.Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:48.36,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,To protect you!Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.82,0:15:06.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Diamante!Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.88,0:15:10.84,Main,,0,0,0,,My strikes rend the earth itself!Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.54,0:15:16.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Take this, and that!Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.60,0:15:18.14,Main,,0,0,0,,There!Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:22.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's hope you can dodge my attacks...Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.18,0:15:24.52,Main,,0,0,0,,With your single, shot-up leg!Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.26,0:15:28.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of dodging!Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.80,0:15:33.22,Main,,0,0,0,,If you won't dodge, you're just an idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.38,0:15:35.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I will return peace!Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.40,0:15:39.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Half Moon Glaive!Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.50,0:15:43.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Trueno...Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.50,0:15:43.76,Note,,0,0,0,,ThunderDialogue: 0,0:15:46.24,0:15:48.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Bastardo!Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.24,0:15:48.28,Note,,0,0,0,,BastardDialogue: 0,0:16:38.63,0:16:41.76,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I owe you one, Robiland.Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.38,0:17:10.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Father!Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.12,0:17:16.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Father, we must tend to your wounds!Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.60,0:17:29.48,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I couldn't protect your mother, but I'll protect you with my life.Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.44,0:17:36.66,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Until the day you can find true happiness, I'll always be by your side.Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.85,0:18:00.22,Main,,0,0,0,,He took down Diamante!Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.37,0:18:08.30,Main,,0,0,0,,He took down the Diamante?Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.44,0:18:20.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it true, Viola-sama?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.18,0:18:24.56,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! Kyros won!Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:26.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca is okay, too.Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.29,0:18:29.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin protected her.Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.02,0:18:35.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he took down one of the Donquixote Family's top commanders!Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.17,0:18:38.92,Main,,0,0,0,,He took down the hero of the Colosseum...Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.08,0:18:40.26,Main,,0,0,0,,That's absurd!Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.70,0:18:44.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Kyros was the original undefeated hero of the Colosseum!Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.56,0:18:50.60,Main,,0,0,0,,We thought no one could beat the Donquixote Family...Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:52.88,Main,,0,0,0,,but they're falling, one by one!Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.62,0:19:00.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Kyros.Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.53,0:19:04.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Army Commander Kyros!Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.54,0:19:16.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Senor Pink lost the battle at the factory...Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.19,0:19:23.20,Main,,0,0,0,,and many others of the Donquixote Family have been defeated by the warriors siding with Straw Hat Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.24,0:19:29.03,Main,,0,0,0,,There are four major opponents of the Donquixote Family left!Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.97,0:19:31.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Bellamy the Hyena...Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.30,0:19:36.10,Main,,0,0,0,,And the two top commanders, Pica and Trebol!Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.18,0:19:37.10,Main,,0,0,0,,And...Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.32,0:19:42.58,Main,,0,0,0,,the current king, one of the Seven Warlords of the Sea, Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.76,0:19:46.80,Main,,0,0,0,,The Final Four!Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.00,0:19:52.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Never expected them to make it that far!Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.22,0:19:55.38,Main,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat Pirates are incredible!Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.54,0:19:59.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we were trying to save ourselves by killing them!Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.06,0:20:04.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, like they say, we all make mistakes!Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.20,0:20:07.64,Main,,0,0,0,,As long as you see the error of your ways, I'll forgive you!Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.02,0:20:13.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Old King Riku, where are you going? Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:16.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think anyone will try to kill me now.Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.66,0:20:18.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll go down to the town.Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.61,0:20:21.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Surely there's still something I can do.Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.96,0:20:24.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I shall accompany you!Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.13,0:20:28.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I refuse to depend on the Government or the Navy!Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.46,0:20:31.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Everybody's lost hope.Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.44,0:20:35.56,Main,,0,0,0,,They think there's no escape from this bird cage, this deadly game!Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:37.74,Main,,0,0,0,,We should all go too!Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.38,0:20:43.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's tell everybody in the town there's still hope!Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.94,0:20:51.36,Main,,0,0,0,,It would seem the tides have begun to turn.Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.06,0:20:58.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Where did the Navy Admiral go?Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.66,0:21:00.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you not notice?Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.02,0:21:03.74,Main,,0,0,0,,He descended to the ground quite some time ago.Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.30,0:21:08.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Gather all the citizens in one place.Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.26,0:21:13.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Somewhere we'll be able to defend them.Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.00,0:21:14.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.65,0:21:22.20,Captions,,0,0,290,,Royal PlateauDialogue: 0,0:21:19.15,0:21:20.30,Main,,0,0,650,,Is he...Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.25,0:21:24.69,Main,,0,0,0,,That bastard...Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.22,0:21:30.85,Captions,,0,900,300,,Fourth Step                Sunflower FieldDialogue: 0,0:21:28.80,0:21:31.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Father, what are these tremors?Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.81,0:21:37.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.57,0:21:40.59,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.99,0:21:44.03,Main,,0,0,0,,But I thought Zoro was keeping him in check? Pica!Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.07,0:21:55.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Diamante...Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.25,0:22:00.57,Main,,0,0,0,,What a sorry state for a Family top commander.Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.91,0:22:12.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Father!Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.89,0:22:16.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I should have guessed.Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.89,0:22:20.59,Main,,0,0,0,,We're not here to fight one-on-one!Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.34,0:22:24.13,Main,,0,0,0,,As long as the enemy still stands, the fight won't end!Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.47,0:22:28.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself, Father! You can't even move.Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.03,0:22:30.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Stand down, Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.47,0:22:32.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I have to ask.Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.41,0:22:36.75,Main,,0,0,0,,What is King Riku to you people?Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.07,0:22:42.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, you had to endure unending jeers because of him.Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.03,0:22:45.93,Main,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for him...Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.05,0:22:49.13,Main,,0,0,0,,What nonsense! You people framed him!Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.72,0:22:53.23,Main,,0,0,0,,King Riku is my father-in-law,Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.63,0:22:56.35,Main,,0,0,0,,who stood by me since my days of thuggery!Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.55,0:23:03.39,Main,,0,0,0,,The Royal Riku Family is revered worldwide as a family that understands the true meaning of peace!Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.47,0:23:10.80,Main,,0,0,0,,A clear sky, flowers in full bloom...Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.80,0:23:13.80,Main,,0,0,0,,A great country filled with gentle hearts!Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.60,0:23:17.00,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what Dressrosa truly is!Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.13,0:23:26.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Kicking you beasts out and returning him to the throne once more is our nation's desire this very moment!Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.66,0:23:28.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I understand.Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.87,0:23:34.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? He vanished?Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.92,0:23:37.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Charlestone!Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.30,0:23:44.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-The hell is that?! That scared me!Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.36,0:23:46.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Now he's on the third level!Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.04,0:23:51.70,Captions,,950,0,620,,Second StepDialogue: 0,0:23:48.18,0:23:51.90,Main,,0,0,0,,That damn bastard! He's supposed to fight me!Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.02,0:23:53.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Does he even want to fight?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.16,0:24:04.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Either way, I can't reach him if he's moving around in the plateau.Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.90,0:24:07.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Prepare to die once you're back in range!Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.88,0:24:09.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Charlestone!Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.86,0:24:12.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Pica-sama, please stop!Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.26,0:24:14.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Pica-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.18,0:24:15.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Help!Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.54,0:24:24.72,Main,,0,0,0,,That bastard! He's attacking the injured!Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.52,0:24:28.00,Main,,0,0,0,,You betrayed us, Baby 5!Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.14,0:24:29.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Steel Mill!Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.24,0:24:30.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Look out!Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.72,0:24:35.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Sai!Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.58,0:24:37.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Charlestone!Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.62,0:24:47.48,Main,,0,0,0,,That asshole!Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.38,0:24:50.82,Main,,0,0,0,,You stony bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.00,0:24:54.74,Main,,0,0,0,,That's enough outta you! Quit going after the injured!Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.86,0:24:56.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Roronoa.Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.66,0:24:58.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Bite Stone!Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.08,0:25:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,,One-Sword Style... Demon Horse!Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.60,0:25:03.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Say, Roronoa Zoro...Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.06,0:25:07.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you know who's on the old Royal Grounds?Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.40,0:25:09.86,Main,,0,0,0,,The king of this country!Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.02,0:25:11.00,Main,,0,0,0,,The former king!Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.62,0:25:13.40,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you getting at?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.70,0:25:17.91,Main,,0,0,0,,On the old Royal Grounds,Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.02,0:25:21.21,Main,,0,0,0,,the former senior officials of this country are there,Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.34,0:25:24.36,Main,,0,0,0,,as well as those samurai and God Usopp.Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.92,0:25:30.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard the whole nation seeks King Riku's restoration.Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.50,0:25:31.84,Main,,0,0,0,,So what?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.12,0:25:36.74,Main,,0,0,0,,That pisses me off! Doffy is the one and only king!Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.20,0:25:50.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What the...Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.16,0:26:03.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.56,0:26:21.70,Main,,0,0,0,,It started to move again!Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.80,0:26:23.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's he going to do?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.92,0:26:34.06,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Donquixote country!Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.53,0:26:39.78,Main,,0,0,0,,He's walking!Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.92,0:26:41.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.00,0:26:45.44,Main,,0,0,0,,The statue's started to move! Run! Run for it!Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.52,0:27:00.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, don't tell me...Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.62,0:27:06.06,Main,,0,0,0,,That bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.74,0:27:08.50,Main,,0,0,0,,So he's planning to take out the king?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.86,0:27:14.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.48,0:27:17.32,Main,,0,0,0,,So that's why he drove me out this far!Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.84,0:27:20.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't catch up to him!Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.26,0:27:27.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I totally got played! Gotta do something, or else...Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.82,0:27:33.54,Main,,0,0,0,,It'll take him just one punch to shatter the Royal Grounds!Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.52,0:27:37.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Usopp and the king'll be crushed to death!Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.38,0:27:39.08,Main,,0,0,0,,There any way to stop it?Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.08,0:27:40.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Pirate Hunter!Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.90,0:27:43.50,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't let you get in Pica-sama's way!Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.50,0:27:49.00,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a pest!Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.10,0:27:51.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Zoro!Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.12,0:27:53.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Not good!Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.52,0:27:56.22,Main,,0,0,0,,If we let him go, he'll...Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.96,0:28:02.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Grandfather!Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.18,0:28:03.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.08,0:28:09.12,Main,,0,0,0,,That bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.20,0:28:14.81,Captions,,0,0,0,,PLAN 1Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.66,0:28:15.02,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Plan 1.Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.81,0:28:14.85,Captions,,0,0,0,,PLAN 1Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.85,0:28:14.89,Captions,,0,0,0,,PLAN 1Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.89,0:28:14.93,Captions,,0,0,0,,PLAN 1Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.89,0:28:14.93,Captions,,0,0,0,,LONG DISTANCE SLASHDialogue: 0,0:28:14.93,0:28:14.97,Captions,,0,0,0,,PLAN 1Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.93,0:28:14.97,Captions,,0,0,0,,LONG DISTANCE SLASHDialogue: 0,0:28:14.97,0:28:15.01,Captions,,0,0,0,,PLAN 1Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.97,0:28:15.01,Captions,,0,0,0,,LONG DISTANCE SLASHDialogue: 0,0:28:15.01,0:28:15.06,Captions,,0,0,0,,PLAN 1Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.01,0:28:15.06,Captions,,0,0,0,,LONG DISTANCE SLASHDialogue: 0,0:28:15.06,0:28:15.10,Captions,,0,0,0,,PLAN 1Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.06,0:28:15.10,Captions,,0,0,0,,LONG DISTANCE SLASHDialogue: 0,0:28:15.10,0:28:15.14,Captions,,0,0,0,,PLAN 1Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.10,0:28:15.14,Captions,,0,0,0,,LONG DISTANCE SLASHDialogue: 0,0:28:15.14,0:28:15.18,Captions,,0,0,0,,PLAN 1Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.14,0:28:15.18,Captions,,0,0,0,,LONG DISTANCE SLASHDialogue: 0,0:28:15.18,0:28:15.22,Captions,,0,0,0,,PLAN 1Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.18,0:28:15.22,Captions,,0,0,0,,LONG DISTANCE SLASHDialogue: 0,0:28:15.22,0:28:15.26,Captions,,0,0,0,,PLAN 1Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.22,0:28:15.26,Captions,,0,0,0,,LONG DISTANCE SLASHDialogue: 0,0:28:15.2