,0,0,,BY SNAIL PHONEDialogue: 0,0:29:16.43,0:29:16.48,Captions,,0,0,0,,CALL HIMDialogue: 0,0:29:16.43,0:29:16.48,Captions,,0,0,0,,PLAN 4Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.43,0:29:16.48,Captions,,0,0,0,,OUTTA THERE"Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.48,0:29:16.52,Captions,,0,0,0,,"GET THE HELLDialogue: 0,0:29:16.48,0:29:16.52,Captions,,0,0,0,,AND TELL HIMDialogue: 0,0:29:16.48,0:29:16.52,Captions,,0,0,0,,BY SNAIL PHONEDialogue: 0,0:29:16.48,0:29:16.52,Captions,,0,0,0,,CALL HIMDialogue: 0,0:29:16.48,0:29:16.52,Captions,,0,0,0,,PLAN 4Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.48,0:29:16.52,Captions,,0,0,0,,OUTTA THERE"Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.52,0:29:16.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,"GET THE HELLDialogue: 0,0:29:16.52,0:29:16.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,AND TELL HIMDialogue: 0,0:29:16.52,0:29:16.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,BY SNAIL PHONEDialogue: 0,0:29:16.52,0:29:16.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,CALL HIMDialogue: 0,0:29:16.52,0:29:16.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,PLAN 4Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.52,0:29:16.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,OUTTA THERE"Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.68,0:29:15.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Call him by Snail Phone and tell him, "Get the hell outta there."Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.42,0:29:27.06,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't have one.Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.90,0:29:32.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer!Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.44,0:29:39.50,Main,,0,0,0,,And even if I could tell him, there's no time for everyone to get away!Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.12,0:29:50.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Go for it!Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.54,0:29:51.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Pica-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.96,0:29:55.58,Main,,0,0,0,,He's going after King Riku!Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.94,0:30:01.12,Main,,0,0,0,,It's none of our business, but I still don't like it!Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.30,0:30:04.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop, you stone monster!Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.76,0:30:08.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Sogeking-senpai is on that plateau!Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.38,0:30:10.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Stone! Come back here!Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.94,0:30:13.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll fight you!Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.88,0:30:21.44,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.36,0:30:30.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I understand now!Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.80,0:30:36.48,Main,,0,0,0,,The Pirate Hunter was right in telling me to save my King Punch!Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.38,0:30:44.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll save you, King Riku, my old friend!Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.04,0:30:46.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, King of wherever!Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.26,0:30:48.52,Main,,0,0,0,,"Wherever"?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.68,0:30:52.78,Main,,0,0,0,,That's "King Elizabello of Prodence" to you, Pirate Hunter!Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.52,0:30:55.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I told you, it's no use just destroying him.Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.32,0:30:59.50,Main,,0,0,0,,He'll keep coming back unless you beat him in the flesh!Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.80,0:31:01.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, what should we do then?Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.28,0:31:10.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Help me!Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.38,0:31:14.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Pirate Hunter!Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.30,0:31:41.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.62,0:31:42.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Give me two minutes.Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.64,0:31:47.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Is King Riku there?Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.12,0:31:54.47,Captions,,0,0,0,,PLAN 5Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.08,0:31:54.47,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Plan 5!Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.47,0:31:54.85,Captions,,0,0,0,,FLYDialogue: 0,0:31:54.52,0:31:57.81,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Fly into the sky and dice this punk to bits!Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.85,0:31:55.10,Captions,,0,0,0,,INTODialogue: 0,0:31:55.10,0:31:55.35,Captions,,0,0,0,,THEDialogue: 0,0:31:55.35,0:31:55.72,Captions,,0,0,0,,SKYDialogue: 0,0:31:55.72,0:31:56.10,Captions,,0,0,0,,ANDDialogue: 0,0:31:56.10,0:31:56.35,Captions,,0,0,0,,DICEDialogue: 0,0:31:56.35,0:31:56.60,Captions,,0,0,0,,THISDialogue: 0,0:31:56.60,0:31:56.85,Captions,,0,0,0,,PUNKDialogue: 0,0:31:56.85,0:31:57.10,Captions,,0,0,0,,TODialogue: 0,0:31:57.10,0:31:57.35,Captions,,0,0,0,,BITSDialogue: 0,0:31:57.81,0:31:57.85,Captions,,0,0,0,,AND DICE HIMDialogue: 0,0:31:57.81,0:31:57.85,Captions,,0,0,0,,FLY INTO THE SKYDialogue: 0,0:31:57.81,0:31:57.85,Captions,,0,0,0,,5Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.81,0:31:57.85,Captions,,0,0,0,,PLAN 5