 0,0:32:02.27,0:32:02.31,Captions,,0,0,0,,5Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.27,0:32:02.31,Captions,,0,0,0,,PLAN 5Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.27,0:32:02.31,Captions,,0,0,0,,TO BITS!!!Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.31,0:32:02.71,Captions,,0,0,0,,AND DICE HIMDialogue: 0,0:32:02.31,0:32:02.71,Captions,,0,0,0,,FLY INTO THE SKYDialogue: 0,0:32:02.31,0:32:02.71,Captions,,0,0,0,,5Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.31,0:32:02.71,Captions,,0,0,0,,PLAN 5Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.31,0:32:02.71,Captions,,0,0,0,,TO BITS!!!Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.62,0:32:05.32,Main,,0,0,0,,That'll work!Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.58,0:32:21.88,Main,,0,0,0,,If nothing is done...Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.02,0:32:23.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Grandfather and everyone will...Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.24,0:32:27.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Sogeking-senpai! Run!Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.30,0:32:38.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Pirate Hunter!Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.26,0:32:41.98,Main,,0,0,0,,How long will you make me wait?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.08,0:32:43.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Director!Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.34,0:32:46.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? If you mean "Commodore," that's me.Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.42,0:32:47.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever!Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.94,0:32:50.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Didn't you throw someone like a cannonball earlier?Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.44,0:32:57.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself, King Riku!Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.22,0:33:00.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Shoot! Shoot!Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.64,0:33:16.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Your target is me, isn't it?!Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.64,0:33:20.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Please stop causing all this destruction!Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.68,0:33:28.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, out of here, now! Evacuate the plateau!Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.10,0:33:39.82,Main,,0,0,0,,King Riku, you must leave too!Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.98,0:33:42.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Father!Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.92,0:33:46.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Viola, Tank! Take everyone and descend at once!Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.90,0:33:49.40,Main,,0,0,0,,His target is me! Go!Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.02,0:33:52.52,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why you need to run, King Riku!Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.82,0:33:53.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Please make haste!Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.36,0:33:59.72,Main,,0,0,0,,No! If everyone else can escape while he's targeting me,Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.88,0:34:01.26,Main,,0,0,0,,then so be it!Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.34,0:34:08.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I see! Then I'll do as you ask!Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.50,0:34:19.56,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell?Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.76,0:34:23.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Pirate Hunter, Orlumbus! Just what are you doing?Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.48,0:34:25.26,Main,,0,0,0,,You really sure about this?Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.68,0:34:28.96,Main,,0,0,0,,This technique isn't meant for throwing someone safely!Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.32,0:34:31.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Just do it already! We don't have time!Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.72,0:34:33.12,Main,,0,0,0,,That bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.26,0:34:35.92,Main,,0,0,0,,He's only going after people who don't want to fight!Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.06,0:34:36.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Ready?Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.28,0:34:37.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.62,0:34:45.12,Main,,0,0,0,,King Riku! You are no king!Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.42,0:34:47.92,Main,,0,0,0,,You're not even fit to be king!Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.40,0:34:53.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Commodore...Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.42,0:35:09.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, if you won't run, then neither shall we!Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.72,0:35:15.80,Main,,0,0,0,,King Riku, did you clear up the decade-long misunderstanding and win back your popularity?Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.18,0:35:20.66,Main,,0,0,0,,A pacifist like you...Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.84,0:35:24.80,Main,,0,0,0,,couldn't even protect his country! Or have you forgotten?Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.22,0:35:27.04,Main,,0,0,0,,A country is all about armed might!Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.38,0:35:30.02,Main,,0,0,0,,A man that can't destroy his country's enemies...Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.14,0:35:33.22,Main,,0,0,0,,is not qualified to be king!Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.04,0:35:39.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll pulverize you and your cheap ideals!Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.88,0:35:42.26,Main,,0,0,0,,King Riku!Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.76,0:35:48.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-The town is falling!Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.50,0:35:57.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Killer...Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.42,0:35:58.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Bowling!Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.54,0:36:20.74,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right!Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.86,0:36:25.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I couldn't protect my country, so I'm incompetent! I have no intention of sitting on the throne ever again!Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.00,0:36:27.02,Main,,0,0,0,,King Riku!Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.12,0:36:28.06,Main,,0,0,0,,However...Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.52,0:36:31.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I tried my best to be a good man!Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.62,0:36:39.46,Main,,0,0,0,,The nine mountains and eight seas...Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.00,0:36:41.16,Main,,0,0,0,,make one world!Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.80,0:36:50.04,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: Chiliocosm - Buddhist term for a cluster of a thousand realms.Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.80,0:36:44.82,Main,,0,0,0,,A thousand of them form a small chiliocosm!Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.58,0:36:50.04,Main,,0,0,0,,And when I gather and cube that chiliocosm, there's nothing I can't cut!Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.38,0:36:55.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Three-Sword Style Secret Technique!Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.04,0:36:59.56,Main,,0,0,0,,"Be a good man"?Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.66,0:37:03.54,Main,,0,0,0,,If you say I'm not allowed to live without committing murder,Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.26,0:37:06.70,Main,,0,0,0,,then I choose death!Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.32,0:37:10.34,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no future for a mass-murdering nation!Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.74,0:37:14.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! You are our one true king!Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.30,0:37:21.64,Main,,0,0,0,,This is why the good never make history!Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.12,0:37:26.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Because they all die like you!Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.92,0:37:33.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Great Trichiliocosm...Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.10,0:37:36.38,Main,,0,0,0,,One Billion Worlds!Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.06,0:38:19.08,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Good! He's escaped into the upper body!Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.68,0:38:20.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Roronoa!Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.04,0:38:47.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Zoro!Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.28,0:38:56.76,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Dead stones...Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.44,0:38:58.96,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Living stones...Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.62,0:39:05.20,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,No matter how many pieces I carve him into, his real body definitely has to be in one of them!Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.58,0:39:09.14,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He can't be in two pieces at once!Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.08,0:39:29.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Whaaat?!Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.96,0:39:47.44,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,There's no ground in the air for him to hide in!Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.52,0:39:51.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Show yourself, Pica!Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.20,0:40:06.18,Main,,0,0,0,,How long will you keep hiding?!Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.38,0:40:09.84,Main,,0,0,0,,By cornering me,Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.64,0:40:13.22,Main,,0,0,0,,you think you've already won?!Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.98,0:40:25.40,Main,,0,0,0,,You think you can beat me if you can cut those stones, don't you?Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.92,0:40:28.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't be cut when I'm clad in Haki!Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.21,0:40:35.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Haki, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.50,0:40:39.02,Main,,0,0,0,,If I knock you off, you lose!Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.92,0:40:43.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Only if your Haki is stronger than mine!Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.40,0:40:47.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to stumble over you here!Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.80,0:40:49.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Quit babbling!Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.26,0:40:54.00,Main,,0,0,0,,The nine mountains and eight seas...Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.48,0:40:55.98,Main,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can't cut!Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.38,0:40:58.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Die!Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.50,0:41:01.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Roronoa Zoro!Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.05,0:41:02.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Three Thousand Worlds!Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.71,0:41:10.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop troubling the innocent!Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.49,0:41:13.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Zoro-senpai!Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.87,0:41:16.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Doro!Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.23,0:41:25.65,Main,,0,0,0,,The Pirate Hunter... saved my friend, King Riku?Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.05,0:41:35.45,Main,,0,0,0,,It's still collapsing on us!Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.59,0:41:39.79,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna die!Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.03,0:41:43.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Help us, Boro!Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.07,0:41:50.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Your turn!Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.97,0:41:56.73,Main,,0,0,0,,King...Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.89,0:41:59.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Punch!Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.01,0:42:30.25,Main,,0,0,0,,That brat... He used my King Punch...Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.51,0:42:33.13,Main,,0,0,0,,to clear away some rocks! How rude!Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.49,0:42:34.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't forget this!Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.77,0:42:37.21,Main,,0,0,0,,That's that!Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.56,0:42:40.48,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing:  Datenshi, Sewil (Opening)  Quality Assurance:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Mr. Luffy, Grug, Datenshi  Soundtracking:  Halee  TC/Infoboxes:  Datenshi  Translation: Yibis